4 winner of my giveaway.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:16.530
Congratulations to Brendan Martin.

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:18.160
You win a $20 amazon gift card.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.500
I’ll be contacting you on your channel for
details.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.172
If you’re finding me for the first time,
just as a way to say thank you to all you

00:00:24.172 --> 00:00:27.810
guys for being awesome I’m giving away a
gift card for every episode of walking dead

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:28.810
this season.

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:29.810
Now let’s answer some questions.

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:35.230
Number 1 - Rachel Kang asks how come the people
in the clubhouse did not turn into zombies?

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:39.590
They had a class war between the rich people
and the poor people, so the ones that didn’t

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:41.980
turn had just been shot or stabbed in the
head.

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:43.510
So they wouldn’t have turned into walkers.

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:48.260
Question 2 - Camille Parmer asks given the
D.C spoon Beth found at the country club,

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:52.480
do you think that Beth, Daryl, and Maggie's
group will be the ones to make it to D.C?

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:55.250
Or do you think one of them will be found
by the Hunters?

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:59.420
I think they’ll be the ones to head to DC,
based on the teaser for the next episode it

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:01.640
seems like Maggie’s group will run into
trouble.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:03.280
I don’t know that it’s the Hunters.

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:06.640
Careful for comic book spoilers for just a
sec.

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:11.409
But it was originally Rick’s group that
ran into them on the way to Washington DC.

00:01:11.409 --> 00:01:15.570
They could just be changing things and giving
that plot line to the groups from this episode

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:18.570
or the hunters could have been that group
that Rick ran into last week.

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:21.960
It really does seem like Rick’s group on
the show is headed for Sanctuary, so I think

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:25.270
it’s safe to assume Beth and Maggie’s
groups will run into Hunters on the way to

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:26.619
Alexandria.

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:31.340
Question 3 - The Mangese asks What are the
possibilities of a Beth Carl Hookup down the

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:32.909
road?

00:01:32.909 --> 00:01:37.700
Unless the groups meet up Zero, if they do
meet up before the end of the season.

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:39.540
I’d also say zero.

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:42.689
If Carl does end up hooking up with someone
eventually, it will probably be some new character

00:01:42.689 --> 00:01:48.450
they meet in Sanctuary or another future location.

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:55.509
Question 4 - Trey D1515 asks Will Beth and
Daryl will make it to the Sanctuary?

00:01:55.509 --> 00:01:58.570
I don’t think they’ll meet up with Rick’s
group, but I do think they’ll make contact

00:01:58.570 --> 00:01:59.900
before the end of the season.

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:03.549
The show is really making it seem like half
of the people are headed to Sanctuary and

00:02:03.549 --> 00:02:10.289
the other Half are headed to Alexandria.

00:02:10.289 --> 00:02:16.309
Question 5 - z Jordan z LFC asks Do you think
Beth will die soon?

00:02:16.309 --> 00:02:18.499
I would be so bummed, but that is a possibility.

00:02:18.499 --> 00:02:20.189
I know that someone will die.

00:02:20.189 --> 00:02:23.590
Right now Bob Stokey, Maggie and Beth are
highest on the list.

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:27.440
I agree with Beth’s comment that Daryl will
outlive them all.

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:32.129
Question 6 - angewomon143 asks Seeing the
new promo do you think all of Maggie's group

00:02:32.129 --> 00:02:35.779
will make it or will we lose someone or all
of them?﻿

00:02:35.779 --> 00:02:39.230
I think they want us to think someone is going
to die, but it seems like the worst thing

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:42.650
they run into next week is a group of walkers
that falls on them.

00:02:42.650 --> 00:02:47.150
So it’s possible that someone could die
later from an infected walker bite.

00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:52.849
Question 7 - Minitrucos360 asks in the teaser
you can see sasha scream for a millisecond

00:02:52.849 --> 00:02:57.959
BOB, which also appears like killing something
in the floor, do you think his killing himself

00:02:57.959 --> 00:03:01.650
or getting killed by a walker or killing someone
else?﻿

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:06.519
I really hope it’s Bob getting killed, because
I really like Maggie, Beth and Sasha.

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:15.840
But I have a sneaking suspicion one of the
women is going to die this season.

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:20.629
Question 8 - Josh Redgrave asks What were
you most afraid of in this ep and did it give

00:03:20.629 --> 00:03:21.980
you any jump scares?

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:26.159
There wasn’t anything that made me jump,
but I did feel really claustrophobic when

00:03:26.159 --> 00:03:31.329
they were in the trunk and I always squirm
a little when the Walkers almost bite people,

00:03:31.329 --> 00:03:35.219
like when Beth was wrestling the one in the
country club with one hand.

00:03:35.219 --> 00:03:41.180
Question 9 - xChaozTeamx asks What do you
think started the apocalypse?

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:43.089
Probably a mutated super virus.

00:03:43.089 --> 00:03:46.379
Because the conceit is that everyone just
lives with it and they only turn after they

00:03:46.379 --> 00:03:49.569
die I think it spread before anyone realized
what it was.

00:03:49.569 --> 00:03:52.749
It was probably something that mutated out
of a pharmaceutical company test.

00:03:52.749 --> 00:03:57.279
Like they were trying to make a vaccine for
something else and things just went sideways.

00:03:57.279 --> 00:03:59.320
I don’t think it was someone evil purposefully
trying to infect the world.

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:00.320
I think it was all just an accident that got
way out of control before anyone realized

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:01.320
what was happening.

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:05.120
Question 10 - Infamous Adam asks I'm starting
to notice that the t.v show is catching up

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:10.449
with the comic, so I was wondering what would
the show do once it catch up to the comic?﻿

00:04:10.449 --> 00:04:13.849
Robert Kirkman sits in the writer’s room
every day and writes stories with them, I

00:04:13.849 --> 00:04:19.419
think that he has a hundred different ideas
for where the show could go if it ever goes

00:04:19.419 --> 00:04:20.690
beyond the comic.

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:25.259
The spinoff show will only be stuff that’s
not in the comic, so if he can do that then

00:04:25.259 --> 00:04:29.580
it should be pretty easy to create new original
stories for the current characters.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:34.790
and one last Bonus question - TheAnanaki asks
Do you think Daryl, rather Norman Reedus,

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.889
really ate a snake in that scene?

00:04:36.889 --> 00:04:40.050
Norman Reedus actually revealed that the snake
WAS real.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:42.960
Pretty cool or pretty gross depending on how
you look at it.

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:47.990
So thank you so much for submitting questions,
again high five to Brendan Martin for winning

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:49.020
